{"schema":"rs-dossier/1","raceId":"2009-04-13-rund-um-koeln","course":{"de":"Ostermontag: erstmals seit zehn Jahren neue Strecke, Start im Oberbergischen beim Sponsor Schwalbe, durch das Bergische Land nach Köln; 205,5 km.","en":"Easter Monday: a new course for the first time in ten years, starting in the Oberbergisches Land at sponsor Schwalbe and running through the Bergisches Land to Cologne; 205.5 km.","src":["S-rsn-b6d27","S-pcs-88832"]},"podium":[{"name":"Martin Pedersen","team":"Team Capinordic","cc":"DK","pos":1,"src":["S-pcs-88832"]},{"name":"Eric Baumann","team":"Nutrixxion Sparkasse","cc":"DE","pos":2,"src":["S-pcs-88832"]},{"name":"Mathias Belka","team":"LKT Team Brandenburg","cc":"DE","pos":3,"src":["S-pcs-88832"]}],"facts":[{"text":{"de":"Rund um Köln ist das älteste noch bestehende deutsche Eintagesrennen; es wurde 1908 zum ersten Mal gefahren.","en":"Rund um Köln is the oldest German one-day race still held; it was first run in 1908."},"src":["S-wpde-9eaf0"],"conf":"hoch"},{"text":{"de":"Die Jubiläumsausgabe zum 100. Geburtstag am Ostermontag, 24.03.2008, wurde am Renntag wegen eines plötzlichen Wintereinbruchs mit Schnee abgesagt.","en":"The centenary edition on Easter Monday, 24 March 2008, was cancelled on race day because of a sudden onset of winter with snow."},"src":["S-wpde-9eaf0","S-rsn-b6949","S-rsn-b5e1f"],"conf":"hoch"},{"text":{"de":"2009 durften nur Nationalmannschaften starten, auf Wunsch des übertragenden WDR; das Rennen wurde dafür von 1.HC auf 1.1 zurückgestuft.","en":"In 2009 only national teams were allowed, at the request of broadcaster WDR; the race was downgraded from 1.HC to 1.1 for it."},"src":["S-wpde-9eaf0","S-rsn-f2439"],"conf":"hoch"},{"text":{"de":"Deutsche Continental-Teams traten deshalb als „Nationalteams“ an; mein Team Kuota - Indeland fuhr in grauen Trikots.","en":"German Continental teams therefore entered as “national teams”; my team Kuota - Indeland rode in grey jerseys."},"src":["S-rsn-c6733"],"conf":"hoch"},{"text":{"de":"Nur knapp 100 Fahrer standen am Start; der Verband der Veranstalter nannte das einen „bedeutenden Rückschritt“.","en":"Barely 100 riders started; the organisers’ association called it “a significant step back” (translated)."},"src":["S-rsn-2553d"],"conf":"hoch"},{"text":{"de":"2008: Schnee am Ostermontag. Das Rennen wurde abgesagt; mein späteres Team Kuota-Senges wich nach Ahrweiler aus, wo das Eliterennen wegen Schneefalls ebenfalls ausfiel.","en":"2008: snow on Easter Monday. The race was cancelled; my later team Kuota-Senges went to Ahrweiler instead, where the elite race was also cancelled because of snowfall."},"src":["S-rsn-b6949"],"conf":"hoch"},{"text":{"de":"Organisator Artur Tabat vor der Ausgabe 2009: „Nach dem Schneechaos bei unserem 100-jährigen Geburtstag wünschen wir uns für den Ostermontag ganz viel Sonne“.","en":"Organiser Artur Tabat before the 2009 edition: “After the snow chaos at our 100th birthday we wish for lots of sun this Easter Monday” (translated)."},"src":["S-rsn-b6d27"],"conf":"hoch"}],"field":{"starters":null,"finishers":62,"src":["S-rsn-2553d","S-pcs-88832"]},"conflicts":[{"field":"winner.team","values":[{"v":"Team Capinordic","src":["S-pcs-88832"]},{"v":{"de":"dänische Nationalmannschaft (nur Nationalteams am Start)","en":"Danish national team (only national teams started)"},"src":["S-rsn-2553d"]}],"note":{"de":"Pedersen fuhr im dänischen Nationalteam; PCS nennt sein Vertragsteam.","en":"Pedersen rode for the Danish national team; PCS names his trade team."}}],"results":{"schema":"rs-results/1","mode":"full","classifications":[{"key":"result","label":{"de":"Ergebnis","en":"Result"},"date":"2009-04-13","distanceKm":205.5,"complete":true,"listed":63,"finishers":63,"counts":{"dnf":26,"finished":63},"restricted":false,"rows":[{"pos":1,"name":"Martin Pedersen","team":"Team Capinordic","nat":"DEN","time":"5:00:40","status":"finished"},{"pos":2,"name":"Eric Baumann","team":"Nutrixxion Sparkasse","nat":"GER","gap":"+0:00","status"